1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:03,630
He looked healthy. That was the problem.

2
00:00:04,274 --> 00:00:05,964
The infected had reached my farm.

3
00:00:06,608 --> 00:00:09,568
And now… someone was knocking at my door.

4
00:00:10,104 --> 00:00:10,944
It was my neighbor.

5
00:00:11,696 --> 00:00:15,186
In real infections, symptoms can take time to appear.

6
00:00:15,937 --> 00:00:19,177
Some diseases can even spread before symptoms begin.

7
00:00:20,143 --> 00:00:21,073
But this outbreak?

8
00:00:21,717 --> 00:00:23,287
Nobody knew how it spread.

9
00:00:23,823 --> 00:00:25,133
So I kept the door closed.

10
00:00:25,777 --> 00:00:27,747
He said his family was hiding near the barn.

11
00:00:28,391 --> 00:00:30,591
I grabbed the radio, hoping for instructions.

12
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:32,130
Nothing but static.

13
00:00:33,203 --> 00:00:34,993
Then I noticed something strange.

14
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:38,360
Everyone near the barn was staring at the cornfield.

15
00:00:38,682 --> 00:00:39,562
Not at my house.

16
00:00:39,991 --> 00:00:41,021
I followed their eyes.

17
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:43,520
Something was moving between the rows.

18
00:00:44,357 --> 00:00:45,037
And suddenly…

19
00:00:48,887 --> 00:00:51,987
Every infected person in the yard started backing away.

20
00:00:52,552 --> 00:00:54,052
That was the first time…

21
00:00:55,339 --> 00:00:57,550
I saw the zombies afraid.

